    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f14588eb9065cc0df97a3458",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・因为存在“差”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1848e45842d347731eac0382a1459af74b86ed3616d710e9eede9216c3aef66b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46b0ebbd61882a8f05bdb292",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了找到对神业而言的最大挑战，\n我即便在训练间隙也不停歇地行动着。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "0120a91b0f4cca4e5ed30dcd1c11f99d686380e6cbf434d0ab0ac665390e6e9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc1d62b204437d2f3bf01b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想看完你至今为止画的所有漫画",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d23a2bc0571b3b97bc4cb8e9b3bbd1af031d066bcd07f3a32ddb684fa03f24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
