    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f9bb659f8b4ccb5325ecae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊ー！　要是有时光机的话，\n真想对那时的我严加指正一番！\n『真是的、够啦～～！』的！　够啦ーー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9b02481e783b6d5b8c4124df1abd679e60e9ec263c116ae748bdde2b72be6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108e153a8b733938448f76fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――！你要看得多远呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee87c788ecb9d8632d103be5ce200b52079158b85a63d12ab7c7d6060ff3136",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137305.json",
      "json_path": [
