      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的话对经典级赛马娘来说，\n『经典三冠』的存在尤为重要呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec947e776ab95582d67492a67ebe6a56ca900f7c130838f5fc52877fc2b6a62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
