    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a1765036e17aea55b990aa0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――三冠赛马娘。\n只有赢下『皐月赏』『日本德比』『菊花赏』\n的赛马娘才能被授予的特别称号。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "2435c5519ba112039506f7c376b220b37c963557523130e420a5453a6a095482",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a1a82a0881592ede842527c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便在迄今为止数千、\n数十万出道的赛马娘中……\n获得这一殊荣的赛马娘仅有7人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a501f960e410b306b981ec6045a625473c3694f5d3c8a461579648e201bf3ec9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
